      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092096">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092101">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1092102">OR AVX10.1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092104">Select from quadruplet of single precision floating-point values in zmm2 and zmm3/m512 using imm8, interleaved result pairs are stored in zmm1, subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
